OL,3,CTwenty people charged over #1million
OL,4,Cmachinery theft
OL,6,FTwenty people have been charged with
OL,7,Fthe theft of approximately #1million
OL,8,Fworth of plant equipment across the UK.
OL,10,FThe 14 men and six women were all
OL,11,Farrested in 2025 as part of an
OL,12,Finvestigation by Cheshire Police into
OL,13,Fthe theft of machinery from hire
OL,14,Fcompanies.
