OL,3,CTwenty people charged over #1million
OL,4,Cmachinery theft
OL,6,FThe reported thefts took place across
OL,7,F19 counties, including Cheshire,
OL,8,FLancashire, Cumbria, Humberside,
OL,9,FHampshire, West Midlands,
OL,10,FHertfordshire, Somerset,
OL,11,FStaffordshire, Merseyside, Derbyshire,
OL,12,FGreater Manchester, North Yorkshire,
OL,13,FSouth Yorkshire, West Yorkshire, West
OL,14,FMercia, Suffolk, Cornwall and
OL,15,FLincolnshire.
OL,17,FThe following defendants are set to
OL,18,Fappear at Chester Magistrates Court on
OL,19,FWednesday, 9 September:
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G2/3
